  - key: hulu
    title:
      id: Hulu yang megah
      en: A splendid hilt
    text:
      id: Sekarang lihat pegangannya. Di Bali, pegangan keris disebut danganan. Hulu
        yang berbentuk sosok manusia atau dewa disebut togogan, dan hulu berbentuk
        Dewa Ganesha termasuk yang paling populer di Bali. Pada model ini, hulunya
        berupa figur dewa berlapis emas yang berlutut sambil menyembah. Di bawahnya
        ada selut bertatah permata warna-warni.
      en: Now take a look at the handle. In Bali, it is called the danganan. Hilts
        carved as human or divine figures are called togogan, and hilts shaped like
        Ganesha are among the most popular in Bali. On this model, the hilt is a
        gold figure of a deity kneeling in worship. Just below it sits a selut collar
        studded with colourful gems.
    stage: 0
    focusHotspot: hulu
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cbd17b602f7e7704ab1335cb39ac04b3, type: 3}
    voiceEN: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae3a66f9e6c67e748a90e83a7fd9d3ea, type: 3}
    cuesID:
