  - key: pamor
    title:
      id: Rahasia pamor
      en: The secret of pamor
    text:
      id: Setelah bilah selesai dibentuk, lapisan-lapisan itu belum terlihat. Rahasianya
        ada di proses yang disebut mewarangi. Bilah direndam dalam warangan, yaitu
        air jeruk nipis yang dicampur batu arsenik. Besi dan bajanya berubah hitam,
        sedangkan nikelnya tetap putih keperakan, dan muncullah pola pamor. Pola
        pada keris ini disebut banyu tetes, artinya tetesan air. Maknanya rezeki
        yang datang sedikit demi sedikit tapi terus mengalir, dan ketekunan, karena
        tetesan air pun bisa melubangi batu.
      en: Once the blade is shaped, those layers still can't be seen. The secret
        is a process called mewarangi. The blade is soaked in warangan, lime juice
        mixed with arsenic ore. The iron and steel turn black while the nickel stays
        silvery white, and the pamor pattern appears. The pattern on this keris is
        called banyu tetes, which means dripping water. It stands for fortune that
        comes little by little but keeps flowing, and for perseverance, because even
        dripping water can hollow out stone.
    stage: 1
    focusHotspot: pamor
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 785f8f2b83f56d04e8db51a282bd0d34, type: 3}
    voiceEN: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 002d180a4c8b3af409f75946f70ffa5e, type: 3}
