  - key: luk
    title:
      id: Luk dan ganja
      en: Luk and ganja
    text:
      id: Perhatikan lekukan bilahnya. Lekukan ini disebut luk, dan jumlahnya selalu
        ganjil, umumnya tiga sampai tiga belas. Keris ini punya sembilan luk. Keris
        Bali juga dikenal lebih besar, sekitar tiga puluh lima sampai empat puluh
        lima sentimeter, dan bilah keris ini empat puluh sentimeter. Di pangkal bilah
        ada ganja, bagian melintang yang menjadi alas bilah. Pada keris ini, ganjanya
        dilapisi emas.
      en: Look at the curves of the blade. Each curve is called a luk, and there
        is always an odd number of them, usually three to thirteen. This keris has
        nine. Balinese keris are also known for their size, about thirty-five to
        forty-five centimetres, and this blade is forty. At the base of the blade
        sits the ganja, a cross-piece that forms its foundation. On this keris, the
        ganja is clad in gold.
    stage: 1
    focusHotspot: luk
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 381cf96d96401f74d943eebcc474678c, type: 3}
    voiceEN: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9f0080649c1a12b4e8a5247460d273f1, type: 3}
